<%- include("../partials/adminHead", { pageTitle: "Đơn nghỉ & Giải trình", activePage: "leave", user: user }) %>

<%- include("../partials/alerts", { success: success, error: error }) %>

<section class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center justify-between gap-space-lg bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-xl rounded-xl shadow-sm">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-space-xs">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-space-sm text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm">
            <span class="flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-primary-container"></span>
            <span class="uppercase tracking-wider">Nhân sự &amp; chấm công</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary tracking-tight">Đơn nghỉ &amp; Giải trình</h2>
        <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
            Nhân viên gửi đơn nghỉ phép và nghỉ việc; admin theo dõi, duyệt hoặc từ chối tại danh sách đơn.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-space-sm self-start lg:self-auto">
        <a href="/admin/requests?tab=explanation" class="flex items-center gap-space-xs px-space-md py-space-sm rounded-xl font-label-md text-label-md transition-colors <%= activeTab === 'explanation' ? 'bg-primary text-on-primary shadow-md' : 'bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface hover:bg-surface-container-high' %>">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">edit_document</span>
            <span>Tạo giải trình</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/admin/requests?tab=business_trip" class="flex items-center gap-space-xs px-space-md py-space-sm rounded-xl font-label-md text-label-md transition-colors <%= activeTab === 'business_trip' ? 'bg-primary text-on-primary shadow-md' : 'bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface hover:bg-surface-container-high' %>">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">luggage</span><span>Tạo đơn công tác</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/admin/requests?tab=overtime" class="flex items-center gap-space-xs px-space-md py-space-sm rounded-xl font-label-md text-label-md transition-colors <%= activeTab === 'overtime' ? 'bg-primary text-on-primary shadow-md' : 'bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface hover:bg-surface-container-high' %>">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">more_time</span><span>Gửi đơn tăng ca</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/admin/requests?tab=list" class="flex items-center gap-space-xs px-space-md py-space-sm rounded-xl font-label-md text-label-md transition-colors <%= activeTab === 'list' ? 'bg-primary text-on-primary shadow-md' : 'bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface hover:bg-surface-container-high' %>">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">fact_check</span>
            <span>Duyệt &amp; danh sách đơn</span>
        </a>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4 gap-space-lg">
    <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-lg rounded-xl shadow-sm flex items-center justify-between">
        <div class="flex flex-col">
            <span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant uppercase tracking-wider">Tổng số đơn</span>
            <span class="font-headline-xl text-headline-xl text-primary font-bold mt-space-xs"><%= stats.total %></span>
        </div>
        <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-primary-fixed text-primary flex items-center justify-center">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">description</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-lg rounded-xl shadow-sm flex items-center justify-between">
        <div class="flex flex-col">
            <span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant uppercase tracking-wider">Chờ xử lý</span>
            <span class="font-headline-xl text-headline-xl text-on-surface font-bold mt-space-xs"><%= stats.pending %></span>
        </div>
        <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-secondary-fixed text-secondary flex items-center justify-center">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">hourglass_top</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-lg rounded-xl shadow-sm flex items-center justify-between">
        <div class="flex flex-col">
            <span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant uppercase tracking-wider">Đã duyệt</span>
            <span class="font-headline-xl text-headline-xl text-on-surface font-bold mt-space-xs"><%= stats.approved %></span>
        </div>
        <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-green-50 text-green-600 flex items-center justify-center">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">check_circle</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-lg rounded-xl shadow-sm flex items-center justify-between">
        <div class="flex flex-col">
            <span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant uppercase tracking-wider">Từ chối</span>
            <span class="font-headline-xl text-headline-xl text-on-surface font-bold mt-space-xs"><%= stats.rejected %></span>
        </div>
        <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-error-container text-error flex items-center justify-center">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">cancel</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<% if (activeTab === "business_trip") { %>
<section class="grid grid-cols-1 xl:grid-cols-3 gap-space-xl items-start">
    <article class="xl:col-span-2 bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
        <div class="p-space-xl border-b border-surface-container-high"><h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary font-semibold">Điều động nhân viên công tác</h3><p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-space-xs">Nhân viên cần xác nhận đồng ý. Sau khi xác nhận, hệ thống mới ghi nhận đủ giờ theo ca cho các ngày làm việc trong khoảng công tác.</p></div>
        <form action="/admin/requests/business-trip" method="POST" class="p-space-xl flex flex-col gap-space-lg">
            <label class="flex flex-col gap-space-xs"><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface">Nhân viên <span class="text-error">*</span></span>
                <select name="employee_id" required class="w-full bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md px-space-md py-space-sm rounded-xl outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-container">
                    <option value="">-- Chọn nhân viên --</option><% employees.forEach((employee) => { %><option value="<%= employee.id %>"><%= employee.employee_code %> · <%= employee.full_name %><%= employee.department ? ` · ${employee.department}` : "" %></option><% }); %>
                </select>
            </label>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-space-lg">
                <label class="flex flex-col gap-space-xs"><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface">Từ ngày <span class="text-error">*</span></span><input name="from_date" type="date" required class="bg-surface-container-low px-space-md py-space-sm rounded-xl"></label>
                <label class="flex flex-col gap-space-xs"><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface">Đến ngày <span class="text-error">*</span></span><input name="to_date" type="date" required class="bg-surface-container-low px-space-md py-space-sm rounded-xl"></label>
            </div>
            <label class="flex flex-col gap-space-xs"><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface">Địa điểm công tác <span class="text-error">*</span></span><input name="destination" required maxlength="255" placeholder="Ví dụ: Chi nhánh Đà Nẵng" class="bg-surface-container-low px-space-md py-space-sm rounded-xl"></label>
            <label class="flex flex-col gap-space-xs"><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface">Nội dung / lý do <span class="text-error">*</span></span><textarea name="reason" required minlength="10" maxlength="5000" rows="4" placeholder="Mục tiêu, lịch trình hoặc nội dung công tác..." class="bg-surface-container-low px-space-md py-space-sm rounded-xl resize-y"></textarea></label>
            <div class="flex justify-end border-t border-surface-container-high pt-space-md"><button type="submit" <%= employees.length === 0 ? "disabled" : "" %> class="flex items-center gap-space-xs px-space-lg py-space-sm bg-primary hover:bg-primary-container text-on-primary font-label-md rounded-xl disabled:opacity-50"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">send</span>Gửi để nhân viên xác nhận</button></div>
        </form>
    </article>
    <aside class="bg-teal-50 border border-teal-200 p-space-xl rounded-xl"><div class="flex items-start gap-space-sm"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-teal-700">info</span><div><h4 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-teal-900">Cập nhật sau khi nhân viên đồng ý</h4><p class="font-body-sm text-teal-900 mt-space-sm">Đơn được gửi đến nhân viên để xác nhận. Khi nhân viên đồng ý, hệ thống ghi nhận giờ check-in/check-out theo ca đã phân cho các ngày làm việc; ngày nghỉ theo lịch không tạo công.</p><p class="font-body-sm text-teal-900 mt-space-sm">Nếu nhân viên từ chối, hệ thống giữ nguyên chấm công.</p></div></div></aside>
</section>
<% } %>

<% if (activeTab === "overtime") { %>
<section class="grid grid-cols-1 xl:grid-cols-3 gap-space-xl items-start">
    <article class="xl:col-span-2 bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
        <div class="p-space-xl border-b border-surface-container-high"><h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary font-semibold">Gửi đơn tăng ca</h3><p class="font-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-space-xs">Đơn chờ nhân viên xác nhận; trạng thái tăng ca chỉ cập nhật sau khi nhân viên đồng ý.</p></div>
        <form action="/admin/requests/overtime" method="POST" class="p-space-xl flex flex-col gap-space-lg">
            <label class="flex flex-col gap-space-xs"><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface">Nhân viên <span class="text-error">*</span></span>
                <select name="employee_id" required class="w-full bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md px-space-md py-space-sm rounded-xl outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-container">
                    <option value="">-- Chọn nhân viên --</option><% employees.forEach((employee) => { %><option value="<%= employee.id %>"><%= employee.employee_code %> · <%= employee.full_name %><%= employee.department ? ` · ${employee.department}` : "" %></option><% }); %>
                </select>
            </label>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-space-lg">
                <label class="flex flex-col gap-space-xs"><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface">Từ ngày <span class="text-error">*</span></span><input name="from_date" type="date" required class="bg-surface-container-low px-space-md py-space-sm rounded-xl"></label>
                <label class="flex flex-col gap-space-xs"><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface">Đến ngày <span class="text-error">*</span></span><input name="to_date" type="date" required class="bg-surface-container-low px-space-md py-space-sm rounded-xl"></label>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-space-lg">
                <label class="flex flex-col gap-space-xs"><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface">Giờ bắt đầu tăng ca <span class="text-error">*</span></span><input name="start_time" type="time" required class="bg-surface-container-low px-space-md py-space-sm rounded-xl"></label>
                <label class="flex flex-col gap-space-xs"><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface">Giờ kết thúc tăng ca <span class="text-error">*</span></span><input name="end_time" type="time" required class="bg-surface-container-low px-space-md py-space-sm rounded-xl"></label>
            </div>
            <label class="flex flex-col gap-space-xs"><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface">Nội dung / lý do tăng ca <span class="text-error">*</span></span><textarea name="reason" required minlength="10" maxlength="5000" rows="4" placeholder="Công việc cần hoàn thành ngoài giờ..." class="bg-surface-container-low px-space-md py-space-sm rounded-xl resize-y"></textarea></label>
            <div class="flex justify-end border-t border-surface-container-high pt-space-md"><button type="submit" <%= employees.length === 0 ? "disabled" : "" %> class="flex items-center gap-space-xs px-space-lg py-space-sm bg-violet-700 hover:bg-violet-800 text-white font-label-md rounded-xl disabled:opacity-50"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">send</span>Gửi để nhân viên xác nhận</button></div>
        </form>
    </article>
    <aside class="bg-violet-50 border border-violet-200 p-space-xl rounded-xl"><div class="flex items-start gap-space-sm"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-violet-700">info</span><div><h4 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-violet-900">Chờ nhân viên xác nhận</h4><p class="font-body-sm text-violet-900 mt-space-sm">Hệ thống lưu giờ bắt đầu và kết thúc theo đơn, nhưng chưa cập nhật bảng chấm công cho đến khi nhân viên đồng ý.</p><p class="font-body-sm text-violet-900 mt-space-sm">Nếu nhân viên từ chối, trạng thái tăng ca không được ghi nhận.</p></div></div></aside>
</section>
<% } %>

<% if (activeTab === "explanation") { %>
<section class="grid grid-cols-1 xl:grid-cols-3 gap-space-xl items-start">
    <div class="xl:col-span-2 bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
        <div class="p-space-xl border-b border-surface-container-high flex items-center justify-between gap-space-md">
            <div>
                <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary font-semibold">Tạo đơn giải trình</h3>
                <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-space-xs">Giải trình đi muộn, về sớm, quên chấm công hoặc sai lệch dữ liệu chấm công.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="hidden sm:inline-flex items-center gap-space-xs px-space-sm py-1 rounded-full bg-green-50 text-green-700 font-label-sm text-label-sm">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">fact_check</span>
                Gửi để phê duyệt
            </span>
        </div>

        <form id="explanation-form" action="/admin/requests/explanation" method="POST" class="p-space-xl flex flex-col gap-space-lg">
            <div id="explanation-form-error" class="hidden items-start gap-space-sm p-space-md rounded-xl bg-error-container/60 border border-error/30 text-on-error-container text-body-md">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">error</span>
                <span id="explanation-form-error-text"></span>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-space-lg">
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-space-xs">
                    <label class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface" for="exp_employee">Nhân viên <span class="text-error">*</span></label>
                    <select id="exp_employee" name="employee_id" required class="w-full appearance-none bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md px-space-md py-space-sm rounded-xl outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-container">
                        <option value="">-- Chọn nhân viên --</option>
                        <% employees.forEach((employee) => { %><option value="<%= employee.id %>"><%= employee.employee_code %> · <%= employee.full_name %><%= employee.department ? ` · ${employee.department}` : "" %></option><% }); %>
                    </select>
                </div>

                <div class="flex flex-col gap-space-xs">
                    <label class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface" for="exp_type">Loại giải trình <span class="text-error">*</span></label>
                    <div class="relative">
                        <select id="exp_type" name="explanation_type" required class="w-full appearance-none bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md px-space-md py-space-sm rounded-xl outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-container">
                            <option value="">-- Chọn loại giải trình --</option>
                            <option value="late">Đi muộn</option>
                            <option value="early_leave">Về sớm</option>
                            <option value="missing_checkin">Quên check-in</option>
                            <option value="missing_checkout">Quên check-out</option>
                            <option value="wrong_record">Sai dữ liệu chấm công</option>
                            <option value="other">Khác</option>
                        </select>
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined absolute right-space-sm top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-on-surface-variant pointer-events-none text-[20px]">expand_more</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="flex flex-col gap-space-xs">
                    <label class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface" for="exp_date">Ngày phát sinh <span class="text-error">*</span></label>
                    <input id="exp_date" name="incident_date" required type="date" class="bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-data-mono text-data-mono px-space-md py-space-sm rounded-xl outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-container">
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-space-lg">
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-space-xs">
                    <label class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface" for="exp_from_time">Thời gian liên quan (từ)</label>
                    <input id="exp_from_time" name="from_time" type="time" class="bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-data-mono text-data-mono px-space-md py-space-sm rounded-xl outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-container">
                </div>

                <div class="flex flex-col gap-space-xs">
                    <label class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface" for="exp_to_time">Thời gian liên quan (đến)</label>
                    <input id="exp_to_time" name="to_time" type="time" class="bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-data-mono text-data-mono px-space-md py-space-sm rounded-xl outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-container">
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex flex-col gap-space-xs">
                <label class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface" for="exp_subject">Tiêu đề giải trình <span class="text-error">*</span></label>
                <input id="exp_subject" name="subject" required type="text" maxlength="120" placeholder="VD: Giải trình đi muộn ngày 15/11/2026" class="bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md px-space-md py-space-sm rounded-xl outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-container">
            </div>

            <div class="flex flex-col gap-space-xs">
                <label class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface" for="exp_reason">Nội dung giải trình <span class="text-error">*</span></label>
                <textarea id="exp_reason" name="reason" required rows="6" placeholder="Trình bày rõ nguyên nhân, thời điểm xảy ra, ảnh hưởng (nếu có) và đề xuất điều chỉnh/cam kết..." class="bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md px-space-md py-space-sm rounded-xl outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-container resize-y"></textarea>
                <span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Tối thiểu 20 ký tự để đảm bảo thông tin rõ ràng cho người phê duyệt.</span>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-space-sm p-space-md rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface-variant">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] shrink-0">attachment</span>
                <span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm">Ghi rõ minh chứng trong nội dung giải trình (mã biên bản, ảnh chụp màn hình, người xác nhận...). Hệ thống hiện chưa lưu tệp đính kèm.</span>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-center justify-end gap-space-sm pt-space-md border-t border-surface-container-high">
                <button type="reset" class="px-space-lg py-space-sm bg-surface-container-high hover:bg-surface-variant text-on-surface font-label-md text-label-md rounded-xl transition-colors">Làm mới</button>
                <button type="submit" class="flex items-center gap-space-xs px-space-lg py-space-sm bg-primary hover:bg-primary-container text-on-primary font-label-md text-label-md rounded-xl shadow-md transition-colors">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">send</span>
                    <span>Gửi giải trình</span>
                </button>
            </div>
        </form>
    </div>

    <aside class="flex flex-col gap-space-lg">
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-xl rounded-xl shadow-sm">
            <h4 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary font-semibold mb-space-md">Khi nào cần giải trình?</h4>
            <ul class="flex flex-col gap-space-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">
                <li class="flex gap-space-sm"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[18px] mt-0.5">schedule</span><span>Đi muộn hoặc về sớm so với ca làm việc đã đăng ký.</span></li>
                <li class="flex gap-space-sm"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[18px] mt-0.5">fingerprint</span><span>Quên check-in/check-out hoặc chấm công không thành công.</span></li>
                <li class="flex gap-space-sm"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[18px] mt-0.5">fact_check</span><span>Dữ liệu chấm công không đúng thực tế và cần điều chỉnh.</span></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface-container-low p-space-lg rounded-xl">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-space-sm">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[20px]">tips_and_updates</span>
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-space-xs">
                    <span class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface">Mẹo viết giải trình</span>
                    <span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Nêu rõ sự thật, thời gian cụ thể, nguyên nhân khách quan/chủ quan và giải pháp để tránh lặp lại.</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </aside>
</section>

<section class="mt-space-xl bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
    <div class="p-space-lg border-b border-surface-container-high flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center justify-between gap-space-md">
        <div>
            <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary font-semibold">Giải trình chờ phê duyệt</h3>
            <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-space-xs"><%= explanationStats.pending %> đơn chờ xử lý · <%= explanationStats.approved %> đã duyệt · <%= explanationStats.rejected %> từ chối</p>
        </div>
        <div class="relative sm:w-52">
